<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1071517706"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:38.895"><div begin="40.905" end="1:09.663" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="40.905" end="46.468" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.905" end="42.770">我</span> <span begin="43.124" end="44.673">把爱铺成蓝</span><span begin="44.673" end="46.468">天</span></p><p begin="47.305" end="54.956" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="47.305" end="48.393">让不安</span><span begin="48.393" end="48.983">的</span><span begin="48.983" end="50.285">你</span> <span begin="51.114" end="52.021">一抬头</span><span begin="52.021" end="52.993">就</span><span begin="53.207" end="53.835">看得</span><span begin="53.835" end="54.956">见</span></p><p begin="55.802" end="1:01.366" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.802" end="57.705">我</span> <span begin="57.955" end="59.486">把心烧成火</span><span begin="59.486" end="1:01.366">焰</span></p><p begin="1:02.156" end="1:09.663" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.156" end="1:03.160">让怕黑</span><span begin="1:03.160" end="1:03.809">的</span><span begin="1:03.809" end="1:05.430">你</span> <span begin="1:05.964" end="1:06.955">拥着温</span><span begin="1:06.955" end="1:08.163">暖</span><span begin="1:08.163" end="1:08.741">入</span><span begin="1:08.741" end="1:09.663">眠</span></p></div><div begin="1:09.936" end="1:23.942" itunes:songPart="PreChorus"><p begin="1:09.936" end="1:16.939" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.936" end="1:10.653">我晓</span><span begin="1:10.653" end="1:11.246">得</span> <span begin="1:11.454" end="1:12.415">时间如</span><span begin="1:12.415" end="1:13.108">雪</span> <span begin="1:13.393" end="1:14.354">有时候</span><span begin="1:14.354" end="1:14.893">会</span><span begin="1:14.893" end="1:15.196">覆</span><span begin="1:15.196" end="1:15.884">盖</span><span begin="1:15.884" end="1:16.085">一</span><span begin="1:16.085" end="1:16.939">切</span></p><p begin="1:17.089" end="1:23.942" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:17.089" end="1:18.035">但是真</span><span begin="1:18.035" end="1:18.644">爱</span> <span begin="1:18.952" end="1:19.839">一如倔</span><span begin="1:19.839" end="1:20.275">强</span><span begin="1:20.542" end="1:21.783">会重生的</span><span begin="1:21.783" end="1:22.352">绿</span><span begin="1:22.352" end="1:23.942">叶</span></p></div><div begin="1:24.488" end="1:56.058" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:24.488" end="1:31.780" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.488" end="1:25.525">第几个</span><span begin="1:25.525" end="1:26.952">一</span><span begin="1:26.952" end="1:27.248">百</span><span begin="1:27.248" end="1:28.822">天</span> <span begin="1:29.106" end="1:30.064">还是很</span><span begin="1:30.064" end="1:30.656">有</span><span begin="1:30.656" end="1:31.008">感</span><span begin="1:31.008" end="1:31.780">觉</span></p><p begin="1:31.851" end="1:38.638" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:31.851" end="1:32.834">用眼睛</span><span begin="1:32.834" end="1:33.420">去</span><span begin="1:33.420" end="1:33.816">素</span><span begin="1:33.816" end="1:34.408">描</span> <span begin="1:34.742" end="1:35.368">你</span><span begin="1:35.368" end="1:35.592">内</span><span begin="1:35.592" end="1:36.311">心</span><span begin="1:36.311" end="1:36.494">的</span><span begin="1:36.494" end="1:37.138">世</span><span begin="1:37.138" end="1:38.638">界</span></p><p begin="1:39.330" end="1:48.191" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:39.330" end="1:40.328">第几个</span><span begin="1:40.328" end="1:41.836">一</span><span begin="1:41.836" end="1:42.106">百</span><span begin="1:42.106" end="1:43.532">天</span> <span begin="1:43.997" end="1:44.560">也</span><span begin="1:44.560" end="1:44.927">像</span><span begin="1:44.927" end="1:45.490">刚</span><span begin="1:45.490" end="1:45.873">热</span><span begin="1:45.873" end="1:48.191">恋</span></p><p begin="1:48.656" end="1:56.058" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.656" end="1:49.552">两个人</span><span begin="1:49.552" end="1:50.210"